DECISIONS 264, EVALUATION.md §2.1 item 3, API.md R6: only Item's default reads b's `M`, a division by
zero, and that default is folded in stage E, not in phase 2. So stage A never forces `M` and it has no
cause; a memoized analysis's cause re-run forces phase 2's reads only, never stage E's.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- b/b.canon --
/// B.
package b

/// Zero.
const ZERO = 0

/// A division by zero.
const M = 10 / ZERO
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

import b

/// A thing sold.
record Item {
  /// Its price.
  price: Int = b.M
}

emit cpp { out: "out/", namespace: "acme::gen", mode: baked }
